SUMMARY:Ask Us About AI Agents
DESCRIPTION:All Things AI (Live)\nEveryone's talking about AI agents. Far 
 fewer can tell you what they are\, what they're good for\, and where they 
 fall short.\n\n**Mark Hinkle** and **Don Shin** are opening the floor for 
 an honest conversation about agents and answering whatever you bring.\n\nN
 o slides. No vendor pitch. No rehearsed demo.\n\nJust direct access to peo
 ple who work with this technology every day and will talk straight about i
 t.\n\nThis is your chance to ask the questions you can't get answered on L
 inkedIn or in webinars:\n\n* What an agent is\, past the hype\, and when y
 ou don't need one\n* Where agents are genuinely useful right now\, and whe
 re they fall short\n* How to tell a promising idea from a dead end\n* What
  to watch for: cost\, reliability\, security\, and keeping a human in the 
 loop\n* Build vs. buy\, and which choice ages badly\n* The skills your tea
 m needs to start\n\n**Who should attend**\n\n* Technology and business lea
 ders\n* Builders\, architects\, and operators\n* Product\, data\, and plat
 form teams\n* Anyone serious about using AI responsibly and effectively\n\
 n**Location:**\nAmerican Underground\, Durham\, NC\n*Come curious.*\n*Leav
 e smarter.*
